orangeark (1.1.3-1) focal; urgency=low

  * OrangeArk: storage-type dialog entry is now Chinese "单独的文件，加密并受密码保护 (.mdz)" (was untranslated English)
  * OrangeArk: node tree names are auto-coloured by depth — root nodes orange (OrangeArk accent), child levels cycle blue/green/purple/red/teal; a user-set node colour still wins
  * OrangeArk: table resize drag no longer "escapes" — the pointer is grabbed at the device level during the drag so motion/mouse-up keep flowing even when the pointer leaves the app window (was the cause of stuck/lost drags)
  * OrangeArk: CRITICAL fix for opening password-protected .mdz — the bundled 7za name-mangling patch turned the extracted document into ".mdd", so opening always failed and re-prompted forever; .mdz now extracts to the proper ".md" and the round-trip (save → reopen with password) is verified
  * OrangeArk: wrong-password retry now says "密码错误，请重新输入 …" instead of silently re-prompting
  * OrangeArk: pin-to-desktop (贴图) follows the mouse only WHILE the button is held — mouse-up pins the image dead in place; double-click/Esc/right-click still closes
  * OrangeArk: the colour palette / bullet / number popovers no longer pop up by themselves at startup (they opened on every launch since the blank-popover hotfix; only the child content is pre-shown now)

 -- OrangeArk <orangeark@localhost>  Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:40:00 +0800

orangeark (1.1.2-1) focal; urgency=low

  * OrangeArk: format painter icon is now the user-provided original brush artwork (embedded verbatim, no redraw)
  * OrangeArk: font/highlight colour buttons are now Word-style split buttons — uppercase A with a *live* colour swatch underneath; the main part applies the current colour at once, the arrow opens a palette (15 standard colours + 无颜色 + 其他颜色…) and the swatch follows the picked colour
  * OrangeArk: toolbar icons are bigger by default (24px LARGE_TOOLBAR instead of 16px); existing installations are bumped once, the 视图 menu can still shrink/enlarge
  * OrangeArk: screenshot toolbar gains "钉在桌面" (pin to desktop) — Snipaste-style always-on-top pin: drag to move, double-click/Esc to close, right-click for copy/save/close
  * OrangeArk: screenshot button tooltip is now Chinese ("截图工具")
  * OrangeArk: password protection actually works — choosing "单个文件，加密并受密码保护" saves a real 7z/AES-256 package (.mdz) and reopening it asks for the password (wrong password retries)
  * OrangeArk: table resize is much lighter — row separator hit test is now single pass (was O(rows^2) per mouse move), wider grab zone (6px), cursor/guide updates deduplicated
  * OrangeArk: bulleted-list and numbered-list toolbar buttons are now split buttons with a marker library dropdown — bullets offer the full bullet library (•◇▪-→⇒●○■□◆△▲▽★☆✓✗♥♦), numbers offer 1. / 1) / 1- / 1> / (1) / 一、 (Chinese numerals), picking one applies that marker to the selection
  * OrangeArk: list icons redrawn — bullets are 3 markers + 3 bars, numbers are 1/2/3 + 3 bars

